【来源4】{"claim": "Evan has been painting for a few years and finds it helps him find peace.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Evan", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-24T19:11:00+00:00", "text": "Evan: Of course, Sam! Painting is a great way to relieve stress and be creative. It gives you the freedom to explore colors and textures and express feelings. I've been doing it for a few years now and it helps me find peace. But unfortunately it won't help you with your weight problem, besides painting I recommend exercising!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
